{
    "title": "Nawy - Real Estate",
    "description": "Buy and Sell Apartments, Villas, Chalets, Penthouses, Houses & Offices in Egypt.\r\n\r\nNawy is a property technology company that offers tech-powered data and a service hub with multiple arms. You can buy, sell, finance or invest in properties across Egypt now through Nawy's app.\r\n\r\nBy harnessing the power of technology, Nawy empowers buyers, investors, and sellers with a variety of tools that simplify the complex real estate process, making it more accessible, user-friendly, and secure.\r\n\r\nDon\u2019t know what\u2019s the best property for you to buy? No problem. The Nawy app through machine learning and tailored algorithms provides a personalized experience that recommends the most ideal property for sale tailored to your needs. \r\n\r\nWhether you want to buy or sell an apartment, duplex, studio, penthouse, standalone villa, twin house, townhouse, serviced residence, retail unit, administrative office, or medical clinic, Nawy has you covered. \r\n\r\nNawy\u2019s app has a multitude of other features that further ease all real estate activities, allowing you to:\r\n\u2022 Search and compare 5000+ properties in 500+ compounds all over Egypt.\r\n\u2022 Explore newly launched projects and have priority booking.\r\n\u2022 List your property for sale through 3 easy steps and connect with serious buyers.\r\n\u2022 Customize your journey by filtering listings according to property type, size, layout, price, finishing status, sale type, features, delivery date, and/or payment plans. \r\n\u2022 Get notified about the best offers in the real estate market in real-time.\r\n\u2022 Have a personal profile where you can mark your favorite properties and/or compounds to return to at any given moment. \r\n\u2022 Get helpful insights about the real estate industry.  \r\n\u2022 Use your preferred language, as the app supports multiple language options including English & Arabic. \r\n\r\nNawy Now: Want to move-in immediately, AND pay with flexible payment plans? With our exclusive service - Nawy Now - you can buy a property from our comprehensive inventory, move-in immediately, and pay with a payment plan tailored to your budget (up to 10 years of installments)! \r\n\r\nNawy Shares: Dreaming of buying real estate, but feeling like it's unaffordable? With - Nawy Shares - we allow you to own fractions of highest return on investment (ROI) properties in prime locations at a fraction of their price, with just a click. A fully digital investment experience with a hassle-free exit!\r\n\r\nNawy offers you access to properties in a variety of prime locations across the country, including:\r\n\u2022 New Cairo\r\n\u2022 6th of October City \r\n\u2022 North Coast \r\n\u2022 Ain Sokhna \r\n\u2022 New Capital City \r\n\u2022 El Sheikh Zayed\r\n\u2022 Mostakbal City \r\n\u2022 El Gouna\r\n\u2022 Red Sea \r\n\u2022 New Heliopolis\r\n\u2022 El Sherouk \r\n\u2022 Alexandria \r\n\r\nTo ease the search for your dream home, Nawy has properties for sale from the top real estate developers in the region, such as:\r\n\u2022 Mountain View (DMG)\r\n\u2022 Ora Developers\r\n\u2022 Al Ahly Sabbour \r\n\u2022 Sodic \r\n\u2022 Palm Hills Developments \r\n\u2022 Orascom Developments \r\n\u2022 Emaar Misr\r\n\u2022 Tatweer Misr \r\n\u2022 Misr Italia Properties \r\n\u2022 City Edge Developments \r\n\u2022 Tameer \r\n\r\nDon\u2019t know where to start? The first step is downloading the Nawy app then you can start your search with some of the best compounds in Egypt, such as:\r\n\u2022 ZED \r\n\u2022 O West \r\n\u2022 Silversands\r\n\u2022 Badya\r\n\u2022 ZED East \r\n\u2022 June\r\n\u2022 Mountain View iCity New Cairo \r\n\u2022 Il Bosco New Capital \r\n\u2022 Marassi \r\n\u2022 Palm Hills New Cairo \r\n\u2022 Solare \r\n\u2022 Mivida \r\n\u2022 Salt \r\n\u2022 Il Monte Galala \r\n\u2022 Bloomfields \r\n\u2022 Cairo Gate \r\n\u2022 Villette \r\n\u2022 The Square \r\n\r\nDownload the Nawy app now, your dream home awaits! \r\n\r\nTell us what you think: Your feedback is appreciated & encouraged. Please feel free to leave us your thoughts and help us bring you the best real estate experience possible.",
